silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_03_arrow_typing_contract_concrete_anchor_5#bodymasstemplate silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassTemplate is The body-mass spec renders the measurement template. The render arrow lands here. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Template', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
